  "reasoning": "The defendant solicited funds from the public by promising high interest rates and using his factories as guarantees, without any legal approval. He collected a massive amount of money (over 5.4 billion yuan) from 2,712 investors, paid only a portion of promised interest, and misappropriated the rest for personal use, causing actual losses of over 4.09 billion yuan. This conduct matches the legal definition of ‘集资诈骗罪’ (fraudulent fundraising), which is applied when a person uses fraudulent means to raise funds from the public for personal gain, with a particularly huge amount. No other distinct crimes (e.g., robbery, gambling) are present in the facts. Therefore, the appropriate charge is 集资诈骗.",
